  "description": "A ponytail with long side bangs, available in six different colors. \nRemixed from \"Arika the 1st Path\" by @antoinepavia (Thank you!) The user has since deleted their account, but it was licensed CC-BY. Mesh/hair alpha from original, hair texture new. It is rigged (simple, but functional). \nedit: Setting this to CC-NC for safety's sake, as a user pointed out, since I'm not sure where OP got their material! \n\nNote: This entire set is free because the character was never completed. However I got a bit further with this part and it shouldn't need much modification.\n\n---\n\nFree downloads will continue on Sketchfab as long as this site survives. I am not transferring my content to Fab due to Epic's business practices. If you\u2019re concerned about Sketchfab\u2019s future, [sign our petition](https://www.change.org/p/keep-sketchfab-alive-preserve-open-access-to-3d-art-museum-collections). If you\u2019re here for the free content, take it and enjoy. \n---",
